			"date": "2025-07-18T22:17:29.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://neighborhood.11ty.dev/@11ty\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>11ty</span></a></span> genuinely something i would really like out of a future 11ty release is a clearer data flow. something i particularly like about lume is that it’s a lot more clear how the data moves around the site. it feels like a lot less magic than 11ty</p>",
